    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Shane",
      "key": "Sat2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "#$1 ShaneJOSH#I'm surprised that you're still trying to make friends with me. Haven't I been rude enough to you yet?#$e#*sigh*...$s",
      "translation": "#$1 ShaneJOSH#Překvapuje mě, že se se mnou pořád snažíš spřátelit. Ještě jsem na tebe nebyl dost hrubý?#$e#*povzdechne si*...$s",
