    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Shane",
      "key": "Sat8",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I've really grown attached to Marnie's chickens.$h||A chicken will never let you down. Humans, on the other hand...",
      "translation": "Slepice, které chová Marnie, mi vážně přirostly k srdci.$h||Slepice tě nikdy nezklame. Zato lidé...",
      "sourceSHA256": "aa428d090510c4464d823d8f38b715c16cfd0cc37f7a44eefb23323ce1712976",
      "translationSHA256": "13009e45b8ccf35a583bc9bcfbdc0badd90d3d69a3d591c6da6c674bb0fa7016",
      "reviewChecks": [
