    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Shane",
      "key": "Sun4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hmm... it's %time. Should I throw a frozen pizza in the microwave, or should I wait?$u||If the Tunnelers win, I'll knock back a cold one to celebrate.#$e#If they lose? I'll have a cold one to drown my sorrows.",
      "translation": "Hm... je %time. Mám hodit mraženou pizzu do mikrovlnky, nebo ještě počkat?$u||Jestli Tunnelers vyhrají, dám si na oslavu jedno orosené.#$e#A když prohrají? Dám si jedno orosené, abych zapil žal.",
      "sourceSHA256": "c4f77d03b51fdbb9046cc38d23f17a6942e17bee863bb1ba6624b1a4ab137d0d",
      "translationSHA256": "b38257f1e12f9931593ec6ab6e114785acf59a45f4e031bbc811a455a9d50ec5",
