    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Shane",
      "key": "event_stadium1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Oh yeah? I guess that makes sense.$6#$b#Me? I get bored with Pelican Town sometimes.#$b#But... I like that you're different. We balance each other out.$l",
      "translation": "Vážně? To asi dává smysl.$6#$b#Já? V Pelikánově se někdy nudím.#$b#Ale... líbí se mi, jak se ode mě lišíš. Navzájem se vyvažujeme.$l",
      "sourceSHA256": "5f56976a3ebbd8cdc3fb97ae3c45c1aafb27374b0b70a181f6cdcf722eec29f6",
      "translationSHA256": "3bff01a784c98898db9897c06d4c641db0828d589dc368ef2d29f3e938ee5085",
      "reviewChecks": [
